   "सह",
   "तथैव खल्वात्मबलं च सारवत्॑ समानयेन्मां च रणे दशाननः"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "kathaṃ nu khalvadya bhavetsukhāgata̭ṃ prasahya yuddhaṃ mama rākṣasaiḥ",
   "saha",
   "tathaiva khalvātmabalaṃ ca sāravaṱ samānayenmāṃ ca raṇe daśānanaḥ"
  ],
